%% Data-flow diagram, level 1 (Mermaid)
flowchart LR
    OS([Android system services]) -- memory, thermal, battery, storage --> P1((1. Collect sample))
    P1 -- sample --> DS1[(D1 samples)]
    P1 -- raw sample --> P2((2. Compute features))
    P2 -- feature vector --> DS2[(D2 feature_windows)]
    P2 --> P3((3. Score with Isolation Forest))
    MODEL[(D3 model JSON)] --> P3
    P3 --> P4((4. Classify severity and explain))
    P4 -- non-normal result --> DS4[(D4 anomalies)]
    P4 --> P5((5. Alert policy))
    P5 -- alert --> DS5[(D5 alerts)]
    P5 -- notification --> USER([User])
    USER -- settings, labels, manual lag --> P6((6. Research and settings))
    P6 --> DS6[(D6 settings / activity_labels / slowdown_events)]
    DS1 & DS4 & DS6 --> P7((7. Export CSV))
    P7 -- share sheet --> PC([Python training pipeline])
    PC -- new model --> MODEL
